	* * * DISTRIBUTION NOTICE * * *

	While nothing would please me more than to send
all of you the source directly, we figured out that at
100k a shot it would take over 3 hours of phone time, and
so even though it is cheaper than reposting to the net, my
neighborhood sites may become slightly unneighborly.       

Do not fear however.  Phantasia is on its way to YOU right
now through this insidiuous process:

	Starting with Bart and Ben, Phantasia will be mailed
down the line until it reaches Sam and Dorothy.  The way it
works is this:   

	1) You receive the source in archives.
	2) You go crazy, rip them apart and compile and play...
	   just DON'T throw away the archives.
	3) For you must forward them to the next succesive person
	   on the list.  The compensation for the last people is
	   that they don't have to forward them.  I haven't organized
	   the list in any particular order, just defaulting from ls.

	For example:

		Bart gets the source 
		Bart mails it to Bernie
		Bernie mails it to Cliff
 
	- and -

		Ben gets the source
		Ben mails it to Brain
		who mails it to Craig

	(and they told two friends, and so on, and so on....)

	As far as sources for other games, editors, etc.  I really
	don't have anything that hasn't come over the net this 
	summer, as my paranoid administrators at my University 
	think only system cracks get posted on net.sources.

	Regarding machinery- all I can say is that this code is
	magnificently portable, and the game is not a system hog
	like it's importune colleague rogue (and I don't have to
	meantion Hack!).  So good luck.

	Remember, the people after you are depending on you.
	Also, the author is supposed to repost a new version
	within the month, so no matter what, you will get the src.

	I will continue to coordinate this, so anyone who wants 
	the src should write me and I'll post a continuation to the 
	process as it develops.   If I forgot anyone, just write.

	Now it is in your hands, starting with Bart and Ben.

	The list follows.   

